Your turn. Say it with me. If I save $10 every week, I will be able to buy a bike.

15
00:01:43.869 --> 00:01:59.640
Understanding personal finance starts with a simple budget. It helps you track your income and expenses, so you know how much to save and how much to spend. Keeping money in a bank account can even earn interest over time, helping you reach a financial goal.

